  AnyVar PCSA ??= 1e4*.StrengthScaleHumerus*MuscleParameters.MuscleVolumeSIScaled/(.Coracobrachialis1.Lf0 +.Coracobrachialis2.Lf0 +.Coracobrachialis3.Lf0 +.Coracobrachialis4.Lf0 +.Coracobrachialis5.Lf0 +.Coracobrachialis6.Lf0 ); ///< PCSA (cm2) of the individual element is total volumen divided by the sum of muscle element fiber lengths.
